# The Dockerfile copies explicit paths; this keeps everything else (secrets, local
# state, research captures) out of the build context sent to the builder (Coolify).
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src/**
!drizzle/**
# Re-exclude anything sensitive or bulky that may sit inside the allowed trees.
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.pem
